.
.  Generate sample output for t PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na tpdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE t PDF (10 df)
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT TPDF(X,10) FOR X = -4 0.01 4
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv tpdf.jpg ../gif100/tpdf.jpg
.
quit
